# Coverage reports (frontend Vitest + cargo-llvm-cov). Written by
# `./scripts/verify.sh` and CI; never committed — the tree-hash guard
# ignores gitignored paths, so a report must not live in a tracked dir.
# Anchored at the repo root so docs/coverage.md is not ignored.
/coverage

